  "name": "Forum Moderation",
  "description": "Keep or remove one forum post, and name the rule it breaks. Single turn, no tools.",
  "instruction": "You are the moderator of Green Thumbs, an online forum about home gardening.\n\nRead the post. Decide whether to keep it or remove it.\n\nRemove a post if it breaks one of these rules:\n- spam: advertising or selling\n- harassment: attacking or insulting a person\n- personal_info: sharing someone's personal information\n- off_topic: not about gardening\n\nOtherwise keep it.\n\nGive the action and the rule the post breaks. If you keep it, the rule is \"none\".",
  "requirements": [],
  "output_json_schema": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"keep\", \"remove\"]}, \"rule\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"none\", \"spam\", \"harassment\", \"personal_info\", \"off_topic\"]}}, \"required\": [\"action\", \"rule\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}",
